Source: pve-compose
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Julius Arkenberg <julius@rkenberg.de>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/arki05/pve-compose

Package: pve-compose
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, pve-meta (>= 0.3.2), pve-manager,
 pve-container, zstd
Description: docker compose stacks in LXC wrappers, driven by pve-meta documents
 Each managed container carries its compose document in its pve-meta
 metadata. pve-compose renders it into the container, turns named volumes
 into PVE mountpoint disks or host binds, brings the stack up, and keeps
 doing so from a per-node reconcile loop.
